Description: Cangjie / Quick / RIME input method for the COSMIC desktop
 Native Wayland input method (zwp_input_method_v2) for COSMIC, made for
 Hong Kong users. Provides Cangjie and Quick (倉頡／速成) through libcangjie2
 and any RIME schema through librime, with a candidate popup that follows
 the COSMIC theme and a libcosmic settings app. Chinese input is toggled
 with COSMIC's own input-source switcher (Super+Space).
